# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is read from the environment (never hardcoded) — keep it
# that way. Anything below would leak it.
.env
.env.*
*.key

# ── OSM road cache (regenerated automatically) ───────────────────────────────
# 72-hour TTL, so a committed copy goes stale within days and re-fetches anyway.
# ~1 MB of derived data — not worth versioning.
roads_cache_*.json

# ── Scratch / audit output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
_audit.log
_audit_result.json
_*preview*.json
_rediscover.log
_discover_test.log

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# NOTE — deliberately NOT ignored:
#   feeders_cache_*.json  30-day TTL and slow/flaky to rebuild (Overpass), so a
#                         fresh clone or deploy works immediately.
#   venue_*.json          auto-discovered venue profiles — real data, not cache.
#   floorplan_*.json      uploaded floor-plan analyses — real data.
#   memory/               project context carried across machines/accounts.
